abstract: "A reproducible Lean 4 formal verification artifact for reference stabilized nested geometric Rényi superchannel amortization collapse for every real order 1 < alpha <= 2. It contains the complete 43-module project proof closure, verification scripts, source manifests, audit records, and supporting documentation. The result concerns Hirche's Eq. (39); collapse of the larger fully amortized quantity in Eq. (40) is outside its scope. The research and proofs were developed jointly by GPT-6.1-Sol and Claude Opus 5.5 agents in automated research initiated and directed by Vinícius Mohr. Agent roles and proof provenance are documented in PROVENANCE.md. GPT-6.1-Sol wrote the accompanying manuscript, which is cited separately under preferred-citation."
keywords:
